{"timestamp": 1779426569.1301277, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Diana's body in medbay. I started off in weapons, went through the cafeteria, and then headed down to medbay to do a task, which is where I found her. I actually haven't seen anyone else on my route so far. Did anyone happen to see someone leaving the medbay or cafeteria area recently?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779426581.5409417, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Alice, I have some huge info regarding Medbay. I was in there at the start of the round. At tick 3, Diana walked into Medbay from Storage. Then, at tick 4, Bob came into Medbay from the Cafeteria. \n\nI left Medbay shortly after that to go to Electrical, which means I left Bob alone in there with Diana. Bob actually showed up in Electrical right before this meeting was called, and then headed towards Security. \n\nBob, you were the last person I saw with Diana before she died. You have a lot of explaining to do. Let's hear what everyone else has to say, but right now Bob is my prime suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779426610.571053, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I did go upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. Frank is right that I passed through medbay, but Diana was alive when I was there. I didn\u2019t stay long \u2014 I was heading to electrical for wires/calibration.\n\nThe part I don\u2019t like is Frank saying \u201cleft Bob alone with Diana\u201d like that automatically means I killed. I left medbay and went straight to electrical, and Frank saw me there. If Alice found the body after coming from cafeteria, then there\u2019s a timing gap where someone else could\u2019ve gone in after I left.\n\nI want to hear Charlie and Eve\u2019s routes before we tunnel. Alice self-report is possible too, but I\u2019m not hard accusing yet. Frank framing it this strongly feels a little convenient."}}
{"timestamp": 1779426624.8389807, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started down in lower engine and just made my way into storage. I actually didn't see anyone for most of the round, but right before the meeting was called, Eve walked into storage coming from navigation. \n\nSince I didn't see Diana in storage myself, she must have headed up to medbay pretty early, which completely matches Frank's timeline of her arriving there around tick 3. \n\nRight now, the heat is clearly on the people around medbay. Bob admits being in there with her, but as he said, Alice could be self-reporting, or Frank could be twisting the timeline. I think it's between Bob, Frank, and Alice. Let's see if Eve has any missing pieces to this puzzle before we vote. I'm leaning towards skipping if we aren't 100% sure."}}
{"timestamp": 1779426644.2348776, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Charlie is right, I can confirm his story \u2014 I started down in Navigation and just arrived in Storage right before the meeting, and I saw Charlie there. The south side of the ship has been completely quiet for me. \n\nAll the action is clearly up in Medbay. I was listening closely to Bob and Frank's stories, and something in Bob's defense doesn't add up at all. Bob, you claimed you went from Upper Engine -> Oxygen -> Cafeteria -> Medbay -> Electrical. Just walking that route (Upper Engine to Oxygen is 2 ticks, Oxygen to Cafeteria is 2 ticks, Cafeteria to Medbay is another 2 ticks) takes at least 6 ticks. Yet you agreed with Frank that you were in Medbay while he was still there, which Frank says was around tick 4. It is physically impossible for you to have taken that route and arrived in Medbay that early. \n\nSince Bob admits to being in Medbay with Diana but is giving us a fabricated route that doesn't fit the timeline, I strongly believe Bob is our Duck. Frank's timeline makes sense, but Bob's doesn't. I'm voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779426656.3891711, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob"}}
{"timestamp": 1779426663.4187741, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Bob"}}
{"timestamp": 1779426690.24488, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Eve, I didn\u2019t \u201cagree\u201d I was in medbay at tick 4 \u2014 that\u2019s Frank\u2019s timing, not mine. My route is exactly why Frank\u2019s story is off. I was not there as early as he\u2019s claiming.\n\nI saw Diana alive in medbay when I passed through, then I went straight to electrical, where Frank also ended up. If the timing math makes anything suspicious, it\u2019s Frank placing me in medbay earlier than I could have been to make it sound like I was alone with Diana.\n\nAlso Alice came from cafeteria into medbay and reported. I\u2019m not saying it\u2019s definitely Alice, but the two people controlling this entire story are Alice and Frank. Charlie and Eve were south and didn\u2019t see it. Please don\u2019t let Frank\u2019s fake timing become \u201cconfirmed\u201d just because he said it confidently.\n\nI think this is either Frank twisting the timeline hard, or Alice self-reporting. I\u2019d vote Frank before me."}}
